<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Attention Scores</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The attention scores are aggregated from 10 samples that specifically include the goto marker “nk\n”. From the attention scores below, we can see that “think\n”, as well as “nk\n”, receive <math id="A4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim 2.5-3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim 2.5-3</annotation></semantics></math> times higher attention scores than an average token. The scores are similar to some other special markers such as “&lt;|im_start|&gt;user” and higher on average than markers indicating the end of a sentence such as a punctuation, comma, or exclamation mark.</p>
<div id="A4.p1.2" class="ltx_block ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="--ltx-border-color:#000000;padding:9.0pt;">
<p id="A4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A4.p1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A4.p1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.p1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">"think\n": 2.436187744140625,</span>
</span></span></span></p>
<p id="A4.p1.2.2" class="ltx_p" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A4.p1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A4.p1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A4.p1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.p1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">"nk\n": 2.993498195301403,</span>
</span></span></span></p>
<p id="A4.p1.2.3" class="ltx_p" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A4.p1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A4.p1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
