<span id="A6.SS8.p106" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS8.p106.1" class="ltx_p">    * LDS: </span>
</span></span></span></p>
<p id="A6.SS8.p234.107" class="ltx_p" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A6.SS8.p234.107.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A6.SS8.p234.107.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A6.SS8.p107" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A6.SS8.p107.1" class="ltx_p">    * Length of LDS: 0</span>
